        "faq_group_hGpDdb": {
          "type": "faq_group",
          "settings": {
            "group_heading": "— Skincare & Orders",
            "q1": "🌿 I have sensitive skin — will your products work for me?",
            "a1": "<p>Absolutely — sensitive skin is at the heart of how we formulate. Every product in our range is <strong>dermatologist-tested, hypoallergenic, and free from known irritants</strong>, so your skin barrier stays protected, not provoked.</p><p>💡 New to the brand? We always recommend a quick <strong>patch test </strong>(inner elbow or behind the ear) for 24 hours before your first full application — just to be sure.</p>",
            "q2": "🧪 Are your products free from parabens and synthetic fragrances?",
            "a2": "<p>Yes — and we mean it. Our entire lineup is <strong>100% free from parabens, sulfates, phthalates, and synthetic fragrances</strong>. Every ingredient is naturally derived, third-party clinically tested, and chosen with intention. No fillers, no shortcuts.</p><p>📋 Want to geek out on the details? The <strong>full ingredient list </strong>is listed transparently on every product page — no fine print.</p>",
            "q3": "🚚 How long does delivery actually take?",
            "a3": "<p>We move fast. Orders are <strong>processed within 1–2 business days </strong>of payment confirmation — then handed off to our shipping partners for delivery. Expect your order in <strong>2–4 days </strong>if you're in a major city, or <strong>4–7 days </strong>for other regions.</p><p>📦 You'll get an <strong>email + SMS tracking link </strong>the moment your order ships — so you'll always know exactly where it is.</p>",
            "q4": "🔄 What's your exchange and return policy?",
            "a4": "<p>We stand behind every product we sell. Returns and exchanges are accepted within <strong>7 days of delivery </strong>— just keep the item unopened with the seal intact and hold onto your proof of purchase.</p><p>⚡ Received something damaged or not what you ordered? Snap a photo and reach out to our support team — we'll make it right, <strong>free of charge, within 24 hours</strong>. No hoops, no hassle.</p>",
            "q5": "",
            "a5": "",
