        "faq_group_tNg6jJ": {
          "type": "faq_group",
          "settings": {
            "group_heading": "— Orders & Delivery",
            "q1": "📍 Where is my order?",
            "a1": "<p>Once your order ships, you'll receive an <strong>email and SMS with a real-time tracking link </strong>— so you can follow every step from our warehouse to your door. You can also check your order status anytime by logging into your account under <strong>My Orders</strong>.</p><p>⏱️Haven't received a tracking update after <strong>3 business days</strong>? Drop us a message and our team will investigate right away.</p>",
            "q2": "✏️ Can I change or cancel my order?",
            "a2": "<p>We totally get it — sometimes you change your mind. Changes and cancellations are possible as long as your order <strong>hasn't been dispatched yet</strong>. Our fulfilment team works fast, so the sooner you reach out, the better.</p><p>⚡Contact our support team <strong>within 1 hour of placing your order </strong>for the best chance of making changes. Once it's with the courier, we're unable to intercept it — but our returns process has you covered.</p>",
            "q3": "🚚 What delivery options are available?",
            "a3": "<p>We offer flexible shipping options to fit your timeline and budget:</p><ul><li>⚡ ExpressSame-day or next-day delivery for major cities. Order before 12pm to qualify.</li><li>📦 Standard2–4 business days. Free on orders over $50.</li><li>🌍 International7–14 business days. Available to 30+ countries.</li></ul><p></p><p>🏪 Click & CollectPick up in-store at any of our locations. Ready in 2 hours.</p>",
            "q4": "💳 How can I pay for my order?",
            "a4": "<p>We support a wide range of payment methods — because checkout should be the easiest part of your day:</p><ul><li>Visa / Mastercard</li><li>Apple Pay</li><li>Google Pay</li><li>Bank Transfer</li><li>Cash on Delivery</li><li>Buy Now, Pay Later</li></ul><p>🔒 All transactions are <strong>encrypted and secured </strong>via SSL. We never store your full card details.</p>",
            "q5": "",
            "a5": "",
            "q6": "",
            "a6": "",
            "q7": "",
            "a7": "",
