        "faq_group_3MGCbH": {
          "type": "faq_group",
          "settings": {
            "group_heading": "— Returns & Support",
            "q1": "🧴 Can I return a skincare product if it doesn't suit my skin?",
            "a1": "<p>We know skincare is personal — what works for one person may not work for another, and that's completely okay. If a product doesn't agree with your skin, you can return it within <strong>14 days of delivery</strong>, even if it's been opened and tried, as long as it hasn't been significantly used.</p><p>💬 Not sure if your reaction is normal purging or a genuine skin response?<strong>Chat with our in-house skin specialists </strong>first — they may be able to help you adjust your routine before going straight to a return.</p><p>⚠️ Please note: returns on opened products are reviewed case by case and may require a brief description of your experience.</p>",
            "q2": "📦 What should I do if my order arrives damaged or incorrect?",
            "a2": "<p>That's on us — and we'll fix it fast. If anything arrives broken, leaking, or just plain wrong, here's what to do:</p><ol><li><strong>Snap a photo </strong>of the damaged or incorrect item, including the packaging if possible.</li><li><strong>Contact our support team </strong>via live chat, email, or the Help Center within<strong>48 hours</strong>of delivery.</li><li>We'll review your case and send a <strong>replacement or full refund</strong>— your choice — within 24 hours.</li></ol><p>⚡ No need to return the damaged item. We'll <strong>sort it completely free of charge</strong>, no back-and-forth required.</p>",
            "q3": "🔔 Do you restock products that are sold out?",
            "a3": "<p>Most of our bestsellers do come back — we restock regularly based on demand. That said, some limited-edition drops are exactly that :<strong>limited</strong>. Once they're gone, they're gone.</p><ul><li>Hit <strong>\"Notify Me\" </strong>on any sold-out product page and we'll email you the moment it's back in stock — so you're first in line.</li><li>Follow us on Instagram and TikTok for <strong>restock announcements </strong>and early access drops before they go live on site.</li><li><strong>Loyalty members </strong>get priority access to restocked items — join the program for free and never miss out again.</li></ul>",
